                    <span id="lblMinimumReqsInClassSpec">You will find the Minimum Requirements in the Class Specification.</span><ul><li><a href='https://hrnet.calhr.ca.gov/CalHRNet/SpecCrossReference.aspx?ClassID=1756' target='_blank'>FIRE APPARATUS ENGINEER (PARAMEDIC)</a></li></ul>
                </div>
            

            <div class="col col-half" style="vertical-align: top;">
                <h3 class="postingHeader">Additional Documents</h3>

                <ul><li><a href='http://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Jobs/JobApplicationPackageChecklist.aspx?JobControlId=437027'>Job Application Package Checklist</a></li></ul>

